 _Text simplex_ is a simple tool for visualizing [lowbow curves](https://jmlr.csail.mit.edu/papers/volume8/lebanon07a/lebanon07a.pdf). Basically, it maps a _text signal_ to a _high-dimensional curve_. This `Java` application lets you visualize these curves using [PCA](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Principal_component_analysis) or [barycentric coordinates](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Barycentric_coordinate_system).

![Tutorial on *lowbow* app](/posts/TextSimplex/SimplexCurve_yt.mp4)

